OL,3,ALithium-ion battery caused fire that
OL,4,Akilled mum and 3 children
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house fire that killed a mother and
OL,7,Fher three children was caused by a
OL,8,Flithium-ion battery.
OL,10,FElisha Brabin, 36, and her children,
OL,11,FLeo, 16, Ellis, eight, and Prudence,
OL,12,Fseven, died after a blaze "spread
OL,13,Frapidly" inside a house on Stone Square
OL,14,Fin Bootle, Merseyside, in the early
OL,15,Fhours of 22 September.
OL,17,FFollowing an investigation with
OL,18,FMerseyside Police, Merseyside Fire and
OL,19,FRescue Service (MFRS) said the fire was
OL,20,Fcaused by an electrical event linked to
OL,21,Fa lithium-ion battery, which are used
OL,22,Fin e-bikes and e-scooters.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
