OL,3,ALithium-ion battery caused fire that
OL,4,Akilled mum and 3 children
OL,5,
OL,6,FKev Johnson, of MFRS, said: "This
OL,7,Ftragedy highlights the very real risks
OL,8,Fposed by lithium-ion batteries, which
OL,9,Fwe confirmed as the source of the
OL,10,Ffire."
